    {
      "id": "2123306572319175143",
      "text": "🎥: https://t.co/OR4EJHsT0o Walker Kessler did not sugarcoat his and the Lakers’ poor play in their loss to the Jazz.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123306572319175143",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:45:10+00:00",
      "likes": 13,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123302776142799148",
      "text": "🎥: https://t.co/EuSlyJfjRf Luka Doncic admitted he needed to play better and lead his team better in the Lakers’ loss to the Jazz.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123302776142799148",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:30:05+00:00",
      "likes": 22,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123296123674911016",
      "text": "Luka Doncic called this an \"unacceptable\" performance from him and says he needs to lead the team better.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123296123674911016",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:03:39+00:00",
      "likes": 924,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123295762994122986",
      "text": "Luka Doncic says fatigue can't be an excuse and that he needed to play better.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123295762994122986",
      "published": "2026-11-19T06:02:13+00:00",
      "likes": 349,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123292973085626755",
      "text": "Walker Kessler felt tonight's loss was more about poor shot-making than lack of effort for the Lakers. \"We were playing hard. I think Vando got like three offensive rebounds on one possession. We got like five shots [on that possession] and just none of them fell.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123292973085626755",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:51:08+00:00",
      "likes": 571,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123292204856902011",
      "text": "Walker Kessler: \"It was a tough night for me... My touch was not what it should be tonight. From the free throw line, obviously, and from the field. But you gotta figure it out and move on.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123292204856902011",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:48:05+00:00",
      "likes": 354,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123291942197002427",
      "text": "Walker Kessler: \"It's frustrating. Tonight wasn't our night. But I think our team is gonna respond well to this loss.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123291942197002427",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:47:02+00:00",
      "likes": 312,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123291463840874507",
      "text": "JJ Redick admitted that Luka Doncic's workload without Austin Reaves in the lineup is \"taking a toll\" and has led to back-to-back inefficient nights.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123291463840874507",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:45:08+00:00",
      "likes": 3121,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123284645257376016",
      "text": "The challenge was unsuccessful. The ball went off Kessler, so not even sure if they were able to look at the potential foul on Luka.",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123284645257376016",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:18:02+00:00",
      "likes": 33,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Luka thought he was fouled on that drive and JJ Redick will challenge the out of bounds call.",
      "quoted_author": "Lakers Nation",
      "quoted_handle": "LakersNation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2123281796075069520",
      "text": "He didn't dunk that one, but we will take the layup. Tie game",
      "url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2123281796075069520",
      "published": "2026-11-19T05:06:43+00:00",
      "likes": 47,
      "author": "Lakers Nation",
      "handle": "LakersNation",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1443416270729322500/pfmulT-l_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "I know he's getting fouled, but would love it if Kessler could go up strong and finish some of these buckets inside.",
      "quoted_author": "Lakers Nation",
      "quoted_handle": "LakersNation"
    }
  ],
